<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <% metaDescription = true %>
    <%- include("include/head.ejs") %>
    <title>Discord WAP</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Discord proxy client for old mobile browsers with Wireless Application Protocol or HTML support">
</head>
<body>
    <table class="nav">
        <tr>
            <td style="min-width: 28px"></td>
            <td class="title">Discord WAP</td>
            <td><a href="/about"><img src="/info.png" alt="About"></a></td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="categorytitle">Welcome</div>
    <div class="section">
        The token can be found from your browser's dev tools - look online for help. Using an alt account is recommended.<br/>
        For easy access, add the page to your bookmarks after logging in.
    </div>

    <div class="categorytitle">Log in</div>
    <div class="section">
        <form action="/main">
            <label for="t">Enter your token:</label> <br/>
            <input type="text" name="t" id="t" maxlength="75"><br/>
            <input type="submit" value="Log in">
        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>